.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH oct-sign 1  "oct-sign " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
oct\-sign \- Sign data using a card
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBoct sign\fR <\fB\-c\fR|\fB\-\-card\fR> [\fB\-p\fR|\fB\-\-user\-pin\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Sign data using a card
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-card\fR \fI<card ident>\fR
Identifier of the card to use
.TP
\fB\-p\fR, \fB\-\-user\-pin\fR \fI<User PIN file>\fR
Optionally, get User PIN from a file
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
oct\-sign\-detached(1)
Create a detached signature
.TP
oct\-sign\-cleartext(1)
Create a cleartext signature
.TP
oct\-sign\-inline(1)
Create an inline signature
.TP
oct\-sign\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
